msgid "Subscribe while saving"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:889
msgid "Subscription when saving"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:890
msgid "Puts an e-mail field beside the Save Plan button. “Possible”: the plan saves with or without an address. “Required”: the plan only saves with one — note that consent made a condition of saving can count as not freely given under GDPR Art. 7(4). Double opt-in applies either way. Has no effect while subscriptions are off or have no sending rule (E-Mail & Subscriptions tab)."
msgstr ""

