msgid "Notice as checkbox"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:912
msgid "Show the notice as a checkbox that must be ticked whenever an address is entered. Unticked, it is a plain note and entering the address is consent enough."
msgstr ""

