#. translators: 1: cookie name, 2: number of days.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:551
#, php-format
msgid "Meal planner: for visitors who are not logged in, a cookie named “%1$s” stores a random, pseudonymous identifier that links the recipe selection to the browser; the selection itself is stored on the server and deleted automatically after %2$d day."
msgid_plural "Meal planner: for visitors who are not logged in, a cookie named “%1$s” stores a random, pseudonymous identifier that links the recipe selection to the browser; the selection itself is stored on the server and deleted automatically after %2$d days."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:567
msgid "Where the planner lists several people, it also stores how many there are, which of them eat each recipe and how many portions each of them eats; they are numbered only (“Person 1”, “Person 2”), no names are asked for."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: number of days.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:571
#, php-format
msgid "Sharing the planner: using the share button deliberately creates a copy of the recipe selection. It is stored on the server under a random identifier of its own, can be opened by anyone holding the generated link, and is deleted automatically after %d day. The copy is frozen: later changes to one's own planner do not appear in it, and the link gives no access to the planner itself. Only recipe IDs, servings, meal type, weekday and which of the numbered people eat along, with their portions, are stored — no identifier of the person sharing. No copy exists unless someone shares. To limit abuse, the IP address is stored in hashed (pseudonymised) form as a counter for at most one hour when a copy is created."
msgid_plural "Sharing the planner: using the share button deliberately creates a copy of the recipe selection. It is stored on the server under a random identifier of its own, can be opened by anyone holding the generated link, and is deleted automatically after %d days. The copy is frozen: later changes to one's own planner do not appear in it, and the link gives no access to the planner itself. Only recipe IDs, servings, meal type, weekday and which of the numbered people eat along, with their portions, are stored — no identifier of the person sharing. No copy exists unless someone shares. To limit abuse, the IP address is stored in hashed (pseudonymised) form as a counter for at most one hour when a copy is created."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:590
msgid "Saving plans: a plan saved in the planner becomes a publicly accessible page showing its recipes, servings and weekdays."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:593
msgid "Where a plan lists several people, which of them eat each meal and how many portions each eats is saved with it and the page shows nutrition figures for each of them, naming them by number only (“Person 1”, “Person 2”); names our editors may note for them in the administration are not published."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:596
msgid "Plans saved by visitors who are not logged in are first stored as drafts and only appear publicly once we publish them; no name is stored with them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:597
msgid "Visitors who are not logged in can save plans too; no name is stored with them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:599
msgid "For logged-in users, the display name of their account is shown as the author."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: number of days.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:604
#, php-format
msgid "Plans we do not assign to a category are deleted automatically %d day after they were saved."
msgid_plural "Plans we do not assign to a category are deleted automatically %d days after they were saved."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:615
msgid "Saved plans are kept until their deletion is requested."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:627
msgid "Abuse protection: when a visitor saves a meal plan, the IP address is stored in hashed (pseudonymised) form as a short-lived counter and deleted automatically after an hour."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:638
msgid "Recipe ratings: logged-in users and e-mail subscribers (via a personalised link) can leave star ratings and reviews. These are published as a comment with the name given and stored together with the e-mail address, until the author objects or requests deletion. Ratings via the subscriber link appear immediately and are stored without an IP address."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:639
msgid "Recipe ratings: logged-in users can leave star ratings and reviews. These are published as a comment with the name given and stored together with the e-mail address, until the author objects or requests deletion."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:640
msgid "Ratings submitted through the comment form are processed by WordPress's comment function, which also stores the IP address and the browser identification (user agent)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:643
msgid "Photos appear publicly without prior review."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:644
msgid "Photos are reviewed editorially before they appear publicly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:647
msgid "Meal photos: logged-in users and subscribers (via a personalised link) can upload photos of dishes they cooked. The photo and the display name given are stored; embedded metadata of the image file (EXIF, including GPS location data) is removed automatically on upload."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:648
msgid "Meal photos: logged-in users can upload photos of dishes they cooked. The photo and the display name given are stored; embedded metadata of the image file (EXIF, including GPS location data) is removed automatically on upload."
