#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:678
msgid "Stored are the e-mail address, optionally a name, the subscribed meal plan, the times of sign-up and confirmation, and an access token that the links in the e-mails rely on. To limit abuse, the IP address is additionally stored in hashed form for at most one hour when signing up."
